+0 with `.K`, `NoExc`, and exit code 0. Evidence:
+[stage3_smoke.py](/audit-output/evidence/stage3_smoke.py),
+[stage3_kompile_llvm.log](/audit-output/evidence/stage3_kompile_llvm.log), and
